                "html": "<h2 style='font-family:Manrope,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:36px;color:#fff;margin-bottom:24px;'>ABOUT THE <span style='background-color:#65B32E;color:#fff;padding:0 8px;'>PRESIDENT</span></h2><p style='color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;'>Casper Chidubem brings over two decades of experience in construction and project management.</p><p style='color:#c2c8bb;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:24px;'>Driven by the lack of quality control in African construction, he founded HINL to introduce structured verification systems. He is leading the development of a Pan-African inspection and construction quality platform.</p><div style='display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;'><span class='material-symbols-outlined' style='color:#65B32E;cursor:pointer;'>share</span><span class='material-symbols-outlined' style='color:#65B32E;cursor:pointer;'>contact_page</span><span style='color:#c2c8bb;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;'>@homeinspectorng</span></div>"
